    "title": "销售单个打折",
    "keywords": "",
    "description": "",
    "content": "<p><video src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202402/c859260ce707de2a8cea91de87fbf8de.mp4\" controls=\"controls\" class=\"my-video\" style=\"max-width:100%\">\n\n\n视频描述\n</video></p>\n<p><strong>业务场景：</strong> 满足老板日常经营中，需要给客户单个商品优惠折扣时使用。</p>\n<p>1.操作路径：设置-系统设置-单据设置-勾选启用单行折扣。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202309/c64a49e60a2c45b3ce8dde1b5dcfc9fd.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p>2.开销售单可以输入单个商品的折扣率，从而对单个商品进行打折。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202309/7e6b0365fea1b28bf696f5c0e1a287cd.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n",
